@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-06 Add Product to Cart

class "Cart UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "Local cart utilities" as Controller <<controller>>
class "bagStorage / bagHelper" as Service <<service>>
class "CartItem" as CartItem <<domain>>
class "BagStorage" as BagStorage <<domain>>
class "BagHelper" as BagHelper <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : Local cart + optional GET /shoes/:productId/stock/:colorName/:size
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> CartItem : uses
Service --> BagStorage : uses
Service --> BagHelper : uses

note right of UI
UC-06 - Add Product to Cart
Actors: Guest, User
Pre: Đang ở trang product detail, đã chọn color + size, còn hàng
Post: Sản phẩm được thêm vào giỏ hàng
end note
@enduml
